# Releases withdrawn from https://packslip.dev/.well-known/packslip.json.
#
# One per line, as TAG=REASON (a bundle URL works in place of the tag). Every
# run of packslip-releases.yml reads this file from main, so a withdrawal
# stays in the list until its line is removed. Removing a line restores the
# release. Do not delete the withdrawn release's bundle from the R2 bucket:
# the list has to keep naming it, and a line for a tag with no bundle fails
# the run.
#
